// A deliberately empty invariants file — no `invariant { ... }` block at
// all. `src/invariants/parser.ts`'s own informal grammar comment reads
// `file := invariant+` (one or more), but `parseInvariants` on a file
// like this genuinely returns `{ ok: true, invariants: [] }`, confirmed
// directly — not a parse error. `runVerify` (`src/cli/verify.ts`) guards
// this case explicitly (exit 3, "declares no invariants") rather than
// silently reporting a clean pass with nothing actually checked. See
// `test/cli.test.ts`'s own test for this file.
